          "text": "An architectural analysis of data decoupling: evaluating Message Translators, Content Enrichers, the Claim Check pattern for large payloads, and Bounded Context boundaries.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_key": "b-04-callout-note",
      "_type": "callout",
      "tone": "note",
      "title": "EIP Part 5 \u2014 Upcoming Series Installment",
      "items": [
        {
