    },
    {
      "_key": "b-04-h2-patterns",
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b-04-h2-patterns-s0",
          "_type": "span",
          "text": "2. Pattern Catalog & Formal Realizations",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_key": "b-04-p-patterns-intro",
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b-04-p-patterns-intro-s0",
          "_type": "span",
          "text": "In this installment, we formalize the following core integration patterns established by Gregor Hohpe and Bobby Woolf, mapping each to its modern cloud-native realization:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_key": "b-04-pat-00",
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b-04-pat-00-s0",
          "_type": "span",
          "text": "Message Translator: Transforms message structure and serialization formats between disparate producer and consumer technologies.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_key": "b-04-pat-01",
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b-04-pat-01-s0",
          "_type": "span",
          "text": "Envelope Wrapper: Encapsulates existing domain payloads within standard enterprise metadata headers without mutating internal data.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_key": "b-04-pat-02",
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b-04-pat-02-s0",
          "_type": "span",
          "text": "Content Enricher: Augments sparse messages with supplemental data by querying external operational datastores during transit.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_key": "b-04-pat-03",
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b-04-pat-03-s0",
          "_type": "span",
          "text": "Content Filter: Strips non-essential fields and sensitive data from message payloads before downstream transmission.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_key": "b-04-pat-04",
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b-04-pat-04-s0",
          "_type": "span",
          "text": "Claim Check: Offloads high-volume binary payloads to object storage (S3/GCS), transmitting only lightweight metadata pointers over message brokers.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_key": "b-04-pat-05",
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b-04-pat-05-s0",
          "_type": "span",
          "text": "Normalizer: Converts heterogeneous external message formats into standardized internal domain representations.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_key": "b-04-pat-06",
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b-04-pat-06-s0",
          "_type": "span",
          "text": "Canonical Data Model Fallacy: The architectural anti-pattern of attempting an enterprise-wide unified data model versus bounded context mapping with Anti-Corruption Layers.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_key": "b-04-h2-invariants",
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b-04-h2-invariants-s0",
          "_type": "span",
          "text": "3. Invariants, Failure Modes & Physical Constraints",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_key": "b-04-p-invariants-intro",
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b-04-p-invariants-intro-s0",
          "_type": "span",
          "text": "Engineering resilient enterprise integration topologies requires analyzing the exact failure boundaries and physical constraints governing these patterns:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_key": "b-04-inv-00",
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b-04-inv-00-s0",
          "_type": "span",
          "text": "Broker Payload Bloat: Storing megabyte-scale documents directly in message brokers degrades memory cache hit rates and triggers aggressive GC pauses; Claim Check keeps broker queues lean.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_key": "b-04-inv-01",
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b-04-inv-01-s0",
          "_type": "span",
          "text": "Enrichment Latency Amplification: Synchronous network queries inside Content Enrichers reintroduce RPC blocking; high-throughput pipelines favor asynchronous stream joins or pre-cached enrichment.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_key": "b-04-inv-02",
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b-04-inv-02-s0",
          "_type": "span",
          "text": "Contract Evolution & Schema Drift: Upstream schema changes must preserve backward and forward compatibility (e.g. Protobuf/Avro schema registries) to avoid breaking distributed consumers.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    }
  ]
}